  "scope": "Every Dynamics.WeakEvolution has actual narrow probability-curve continuity, proved from its compact-smooth test continuity and finite-horizon moment bound. Genuine smooth convolution approximation and quantitative cutoff errors justify the criterion. Exact Euclidean generator change of coordinates is proved without dimension factors. Actual weak equation and temporal integrability extend to bounded smooth tests with bounded gradient and Laplacian by spatial and temporal dominated convergence.",
